window.LEARNING = {"version":"1.0","sourceCommit":"1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a","sourceDate":"2026-10-17","scope":{"zh":"本教材含 17 個學科路徑與 15 個主論文深讀起點。深讀已讀官方原始碼的引言、主定理與證明路線；沒有聲稱逐一獨立核驗 719 篇全文，也沒有重跑全部 Lean 或計算證書。「主張」意指該版本論文聲稱的結論；例題是教學示範，應用路徑為明示推論。","en":"This material contains 17 discipline tracks and 15 main-paper deep-read starting points. The introductions, main statements and proof roadmaps were read from official source files. It does not claim independent full verification of all 719 manuscripts, nor reruns of all Lean or computation certificates. “Claim” denotes the manuscript’s assertion at this revision; examples teach concepts, and application paths are labeled inferences."},"readingLevels":[{"id":"catalogue","label":{"zh":"目錄與摘要層","en":"Catalogue and abstract level"}},{"id":"source-read-not-independently-verified","label":{"zh":"主論文引言／定理深讀，未獨立驗證","en":"Main-paper introduction/theorem deep read; not independently verified"}},{"id":"reproduced-proof","label":{"zh":"本次未達：獨立重現證明","en":"Not reached here: independently reproduced proof"}}],"recommendedPaths":[{"name":{"zh":"物理博士路線","en":"Physics PhD route"},"families":["268","271","265","266","221","362"],"note":{"zh":"由有限自旋與量測開始，進入熱力學極限、糾纏與場論 PDE。","en":"Begin with finite spins and measurements, then thermodynamic limits, entanglement and field PDE."}},{"name":{"zh":"直覺入門路線","en":"Intuitive entry route"},"families":["179","113","158","159","017"],"note":{"zh":"先完整算小例子，再閱讀存在性與漸近結論。","en":"Compute small examples fully before tackling existence and asymptotic claims."}},{"name":{"zh":"演算法與數論路線","en":"Algorithms and number theory route"},"families":["107","102","003","002"],"note":{"zh":"先分清算術複雜度、位元時間、困難性與算術假設。","en":"First separate arithmetic complexity, bit time, hardness and arithmetic hypotheses."}}],"tracks":[{"id":1,"name":{"zh":"數論","en":"Number theory"},"prerequisites":{"zh":"整數除法與同餘 → 級數、複數與微積分 → 群、域與複分析。先選家族 017；再進入 003、002。","en":"Integer division and congruences → series, complex numbers and calculus → groups, fields and complex analysis. Start with family 017, then 003 and 002."},"example":{"zh":"比較 22/7 與 355/113 的 π 近似誤差。單一極佳近似不等於無窮多個分母都達到同一誤差指數。","en":"Compare the errors of 22/7 and 355/113 as approximations to π. A single exceptional approximation says nothing about infinitely many denominators."},"formal":{"zh":"學會讀量詞：對每個 ε>0，存在 Q(ε)，使所有 q≥Q(ε)……；再分辨存在性、有效常數與演算法。","en":"Read the quantifiers: for every ε>0 there exists Q(ε) such that for all q≥Q(ε)… Distinguish existence, effective constants and algorithms."},"assessment":{"zh":"檢查解析延拓、Euler 因子、局部例外質數、條件性引用，以及證明的均勻性。數值檢查有限個零點不能證明無窮區域無零點。","en":"Check analytic continuation, Euler factors, exceptional local primes, conditional dependencies and uniform estimates. Testing finitely many zeros cannot prove a zero-free infinite region."},"applications":{"zh":"已知方法可用於整數計算與編碼；本批新主張的延伸可研究有限域平方根與有理點演算法。不能直接推論破解橢圓曲線密碼。","en":"Established methods support arithmetic computation and coding. Proposed extensions here concern finite-field square roots and rational-point algorithms; they do not imply a break of elliptic-curve cryptography."}},{"id":3,"name":{"zh":"代數與複幾何","en":"Algebraic and complex geometry"},"prerequisites":{"zh":"多項式方程 → 線性代數、複分析與拓樸 → 流形、層、上同調。","en":"Polynomial equations → linear algebra, complex analysis and topology → manifolds, sheaves and cohomology."},"example":{"zh":"圓 x²+y²=1 可由斜率 t 參數化：x=(1−t²)/(1+t²)、y=2t/(1+t²)。這說明以代數描述幾何的起點，但不是一般橢圓曲線的參數化。","en":"The circle x²+y²=1 has rational parametrization x=(1−t²)/(1+t²), y=2t/(1+t²). This illustrates algebraic geometry, but is not a parametrization of a general elliptic curve."},"formal":{"zh":"把「每個上同調類皆來自代數循環」拆成係數域、餘維、等價關係與實現函子四件事。","en":"Unpack a statement that a cohomology class comes from a cycle into its coefficient field, codimension, equivalence relation and realization functor."},"assessment":{"zh":"檢查光滑、射影、特徵零等假設；專化至正特徵時，是否同時保留所有宣稱的實現。不要把有理係數結論升級為整數係數。","en":"Check smoothness, projectivity and characteristic assumptions, and whether specialization preserves every claimed realization. A rational-coefficient theorem is not an integral theorem."},"applications":{"zh":"既有連結包含代數統計、錯誤更正碼與鏡像對稱。由此批深層循環定理到工程工具仍需額外的有效計算與建模。","en":"Established connections include algebraic statistics, error-correcting codes and mirror symmetry. Turning new cycle theorems into engineering tools requires additional effective algorithms and modeling."}},{"id":10,"name":{"zh":"實與複分析","en":"Real and complex analysis"},"prerequisites":{"zh":"極限、導數與積分 → 一致收斂、測度 → Fourier 分析與全純函數。","en":"Limits, differentiation and integration → uniform convergence and measure → Fourier analysis and holomorphic functions."},"example":{"zh":"fₙ(x)=xⁿ 在 [0,1] 逐點收斂，但極限在 x=1 不連續；所以不能僅憑逐點收斂交換所有操作。","en":"The functions fₙ(x)=xⁿ converge pointwise on [0,1], but their limit is discontinuous at 1. Pointwise convergence does not justify arbitrary interchange of operations."},"formal":{"zh":"對估計式標明函數空間、範數、積分測度與常數依賴；區分幾乎處處與每一點。","en":"For each estimate record the function space, norm, measure and constant dependence. Distinguish almost-everywhere statements from pointwise statements."},"assessment":{"zh":"逐一核對交換極限與積分所用的控制函數；檢查端點指數與緊緻性是否足夠。","en":"Check domination for each exchange of limits and integrals, endpoint exponents and the compactness actually available."},"applications":{"zh":"訊號重建、光學與 PDE 都使用分析估計；新估計需轉成有限解析度與誤差預算才可進入數值設計。","en":"Signal reconstruction, optics and PDE use analytic estimates. New bounds need finite-resolution error budgets before numerical deployment."}},{"id":8,"name":{"zh":"凸與度量幾何","en":"Convex and metric geometry"},"prerequisites":{"zh":"向量與距離 → 凸集合、內積與積分 → 凸對偶和高維幾何。","en":"Vectors and distance → convex sets, inner products and integration → convex duality and high-dimensional geometry."},"example":{"zh":"單位圓內任兩點的線段仍在圓內；環形區域則否。凸性讓局部支撐超平面提供全域資訊。","en":"A line segment joining two points of a disk stays in the disk; the same fails for an annulus. Convexity lets supporting hyperplanes convey global information."},"formal":{"zh":"分清體積、Gaussian 測度、覆蓋密度及格點限制；漸近 Θ(n log n) 並未指定每個有限 n 的最佳常數。","en":"Distinguish volume, Gaussian measure, covering density and lattice restrictions. An asymptotic Θ(n log n) order does not give the best constant for every finite n."},"assessment":{"zh":"檢查平移、仿射與尺度正規化；是否只在凸體／對稱凸體／格點中取極值。","en":"Check translation, affine and scale normalization, and whether optimization ranges over convex bodies, symmetric bodies or lattices."},"applications":{"zh":"可連結壓縮感知、配置與覆蓋設計；從極值存在性到可實作配置需要構造演算法。","en":"Connections include compressed sensing and coverage design. Existence of an extremizer still requires a constructive algorithm for implementation."}},{"id":14,"name":{"zh":"理論計算機科學","en":"Theoretical computer science"},"prerequisites":{"zh":"程式與離散數學 → 演算法複雜度、機率 → NP 歸約、隨機演算法、半正定規劃。","en":"Programming and discrete mathematics → complexity and probability → NP reductions, randomized algorithms and semidefinite programming."},"example":{"zh":"三角形的 Max-Cut 最多切開 2 條邊；把每點分到兩側即可窮舉。找一個好切割、證明最優、計數全部最優解是不同問題。","en":"A triangle has maximum cut size 2; enumerate its two-way partitions. Finding a good cut, certifying optimality and counting all optima are different tasks."},"formal":{"zh":"記錄輸入編碼、位元時間或算術次數、誤差 ε、失敗率 δ，以及參數是在輸入中還是固定。","en":"Record input encoding, bit time versus arithmetic operations, error ε, failure probability δ and which parameters are fixed rather than part of the input."},"assessment":{"zh":"積分間隙不是 NP 困難性歸約；小尺寸實驗不是漸近指數證明；理論多項式不保證實務快速。","en":"An integrality gap is not an NP-hardness reduction. Small benchmarks do not prove an asymptotic exponent, and polynomial time need not be practically fast."},"applications":{"zh":"家族 102、107、113 分別連結近似極限、矩陣乘法和隨機計數；都需要核對完整歸約或誤差分析。","en":"Families 102, 107 and 113 connect to approximation limits, matrix multiplication and randomized counting; each requires auditing the full reduction or error analysis."}},{"id":12,"name":{"zh":"動力系統與遍歷理論","en":"Dynamical systems and ergodic theory"},"prerequisites":{"zh":"微分方程或迭代映射 → 測度與機率 → 不變測度、遍歷性與熵。","en":"Differential equations or iterated maps → measure and probability → invariant measures, ergodicity and entropy."},"example":{"zh":"圓周旋轉 x↦x+α mod 1：有理 α 產生週期軌道，無理 α 的軌道稠密。稠密、等分布、混合仍是不同性質。","en":"For rotation x↦x+α mod 1, rational α gives periodic orbits and irrational α gives dense orbits. Density, equidistribution and mixing are distinct."},"formal":{"zh":"區分時間平均與空間平均、拓樸與測度熵、光滑度 C¹ 與更高階；結論通常依賴這些選擇。","en":"Separate time and space averages, topological and measure entropy, and C¹ from higher smoothness; the conclusions often depend on these choices."},"assessment":{"zh":"查明零測度例外集、極限次序及是否有速率。有限軌跡看似混亂並不是正熵證明。","en":"Track exceptional null sets, order of limits and rates. A chaotic-looking finite trajectory does not prove positive entropy."},"applications":{"zh":"可學習統計力學與非線性控制的理論基礎；定性復現不等於可預測的有限時間回歸。","en":"This supplies foundations for statistical mechanics and nonlinear control. Qualitative recurrence is not a finite-time predictive return bound."}},{"id":13,"name":{"zh":"組合數學","en":"Combinatorics"},"prerequisites":{"zh":"集合、計數與圖 → 機率方法 → 極值、加法組合與結構定理。","en":"Sets, counting and graphs → probabilistic method → extremal, additive and structural combinatorics."},"example":{"zh":"{1,2,4,5} 中沒有三項非恆定等差級數；{1,3,5} 有公差 2。先枚舉小例子再學 rₖ(N)。","en":"The set {1,2,4,5} has no nonconstant three-term arithmetic progression; {1,3,5} does, with common difference 2. Enumerate small examples before studying rₖ(N)."},"formal":{"zh":"明確說明簡單圖或多重圖、等差公差是否非零、常數能否依賴 k。","en":"Specify simple versus multigraphs, nonzero progression differences and whether constants may depend on k."},"assessment":{"zh":"反例必須滿足原猜想全部假設；有限搜尋排除到 N 不能推出無窮非存在性。","en":"A counterexample must satisfy every hypothesis of the conjecture. Finite search up to N cannot establish nonexistence for all sizes."},"applications":{"zh":"排程、通信碼與離散設計可受啟發；家族 158、159、179 提供幾何著色、等差結構與自相關導讀。","en":"Scheduling, communication codes and discrete design provide applications; families 158, 159 and 179 teach geometric coloring, arithmetic structure and autocorrelation."}},{"id":2,"name":{"zh":"代數","en":"Algebra"},"prerequisites":{"zh":"矩陣與多項式 → 群、環、域 → 模、表示與同調。","en":"Matrices and polynomials → groups, rings and fields → modules, representations and homology."},"example":{"zh":"有限方陣 AB=I 可推出 BA=I；在無窮維向量空間，左右位移算子顯示單側逆與雙側逆可不同。","en":"For finite square matrices, AB=I implies BA=I. On an infinite-dimensional space, left and right shifts show that a one-sided inverse need not be two-sided."},"formal":{"zh":"保留特徵、交換性、有限生成與單位元假設；同一名詞在環、群環與算子代數中不宜混用。","en":"Retain characteristic, commutativity, finite-generation and identity assumptions. Similar terminology across rings, group rings and operator algebras needs care."},"assessment":{"zh":"核對構造是否仍留在原指定類別；形式計算有無偷偷假設可交換或可逆。","en":"Check whether constructions remain in the specified class and whether manipulations silently assume commutativity or invertibility."},"applications":{"zh":"代數方法支援編碼、符號運算和對稱分析；非構造反例通常不能直接轉成應用程式。","en":"Algebra supports coding, symbolic computation and symmetry analysis; a nonconstructive counterexample rarely becomes an application directly."}},{"id":15,"name":{"zh":"機率與統計力學","en":"Probability and statistical mechanics"},"prerequisites":{"zh":"機率分布、期望與條件機率 → 大數法則與 Gibbs 分布 → 隨機過程、極限定理與相變。","en":"Distributions, expectation and conditioning → laws of large numbers and Gibbs measures → stochastic processes, limit theorems and phase transitions."},"example":{"zh":"兩個 Ising 自旋、H=−Js₁s₂：Z=4 cosh(βJ)，相關 ⟨s₁s₂⟩=tanh(βJ)。有限系統可直接驗算。","en":"For two Ising spins with H=−Js₁s₂, Z=4 cosh(βJ) and ⟨s₁s₂⟩=tanh(βJ). This finite system can be checked exactly."},"formal":{"zh":"區分 quenched E log Z 與 annealed log E Z；記錄 disorder、體積與溫度極限。","en":"Distinguish quenched E log Z from annealed log E Z and track disorder, volume and temperature limits."},"assessment":{"zh":"檢查矩條件、獨立性、均勻可積性與可交換極限；變分上界不自動等於真實自由能。","en":"Check moment assumptions, independence, uniform integrability and exchange of limits. A variational upper bound is not automatically the true free energy."},"applications":{"zh":"家族 221 連結稀疏自旋玻璃與隨機約束；可探索訊息傳遞，但變分公式本身不保證高效求全域極值。","en":"Family 221 links diluted spin glasses to random constraints. Message passing is a possible direction, but the variational formula does not guarantee efficient global optimization."}},{"id":6,"name":{"zh":"數理邏輯","en":"Mathematical logic"},"prerequisites":{"zh":"命題、量詞與歸納 → 可計算性、集合論 → 模型論或證明論。","en":"Propositions, quantifiers and induction → computability and set theory → model theory or proof theory."},"example":{"zh":"「每個輸入都可手動解」不等於存在單一演算法處理所有輸入；停機問題的對角論證正是全稱演算法的限制。","en":"Being able to solve particular instances is not the existence of one algorithm for all instances. The halting-problem diagonal argument concerns this uniform requirement."},"formal":{"zh":"寫清公理系統、可定義性、語言大小及相對一致性；不可判定、獨立與困難性並不等義。","en":"Specify the axiom system, definability, language size and relative consistency. Undecidability, independence and computational hardness are different notions."},"assessment":{"zh":"若結論使用 CH 等假設，必須保留；Lean 中的定理可能依賴明列公理，編譯成功不代表沒有數學前提。","en":"Retain assumptions such as CH. A Lean theorem may use explicit axioms; successful compilation does not mean absence of mathematical premises."},"applications":{"zh":"可用於驗證語言、規格與自動證明的邊界；不應把不可判定性誤讀為所有有限實例無法計算。","en":"Applications concern specification languages and limits of automated proof. Undecidability does not make every finite instance uncomputable."}},{"id":5,"name":{"zh":"群論","en":"Group theory"},"prerequisites":{"zh":"置換與對稱 → 群作用、商群 → 群表示、幾何群論。","en":"Permutations and symmetry → actions and quotient groups → representations and geometric group theory."},"example":{"zh":"正三角形的 6 個對稱形成非交換群：先旋轉再鏡射通常不同於先鏡射再旋轉。","en":"The six symmetries of a triangle form a noncommutative group: rotating then reflecting need not equal reflecting then rotating."},"formal":{"zh":"分清抽象同構、拓樸同構、擬等距與測度等價；群表示的係數域亦屬假設。","en":"Separate abstract isomorphism, topological isomorphism, quasi-isometry and measure equivalence; the representation field is also part of the assumptions."},"assessment":{"zh":"檢查有限呈示、可數性、剩餘有限性等性質在構造與極限中是否保留。","en":"Check preservation of finite presentation, countability and residual finiteness under constructions and limits."},"applications":{"zh":"對稱可減少物理模型與計算的自由度；深層群存在性結論需要另建有效表示才可計算。","en":"Symmetry reduces physical and computational degrees of freedom; deep existence results need effective representations to become computational tools."}},{"id":17,"name":{"zh":"數學物理","en":"Mathematical physics"},"prerequisites":{"zh":"古典力學、量子力學與統計力學 → 自伴算子、張量積 → 熱力學極限與多體估計。","en":"Classical, quantum and statistical mechanics → self-adjoint operators and tensor products → thermodynamic limits and many-body estimates."},"example":{"zh":"兩個 spin-1/2 的 S₁·S₂=(S總²−S₁²−S₂²)/2，在三重態為 1/4，單重態為 −3/4。這把矩陣問題化為對稱分類。","en":"For two spin-1/2 particles, S₁·S₂=(S_total²−S₁²−S₂²)/2 gives 1/4 on the triplet and −3/4 on the singlet, reducing a matrix problem by symmetry."},"formal":{"zh":"固定 ħ、kB、耦合與邊界條件；有限體積 gap、無窮體積 gap、自發磁化及有限溫度磁化是不同命題。","en":"Fix ħ, kB, coupling and boundary conditions. Finite-volume gaps, infinite-volume gaps, spontaneous magnetization and finite-temperature magnetization are distinct claims."},"assessment":{"zh":"重點檢查體積→∞、場→0、溫度→0 的順序；把物理近似、數值證據與嚴格界分開。","en":"Audit the order volume→∞, field→0 and temperature→0, and distinguish physical approximation, numerical evidence and rigorous bounds."},"applications":{"zh":"優先讀 268、271、265、266，分別連結自旋鏈、磁性、張量網路與量子量測；應用必須在定理假設內。","en":"Prioritize 268, 271, 265 and 266 for spin chains, magnetism, tensor networks and quantum measurements, keeping applications within the stated hypotheses."}},{"id":16,"name":{"zh":"算子代數","en":"Operator algebras"},"prerequisites":{"zh":"線性代數與量子算子 → Hilbert 空間與有界算子 → C*／von Neumann 代數。","en":"Linear algebra and quantum operators → Hilbert spaces and bounded operators → C* and von Neumann algebras."},"example":{"zh":"Pauli 矩陣 σxσz=−σzσx，顯示可觀測量代數一般非交換；有限矩陣只是無窮維理論的起點。","en":"The Pauli relation σxσz=−σzσx shows noncommutativity of observables; finite matrices are only the starting point for infinite-dimensional theory."},"formal":{"zh":"弄清範數拓樸、強／弱算子拓樸、跡與因子類型；同構與近似嵌入的量詞不同。","en":"Distinguish norm, strong and weak operator topologies, traces and factor types; isomorphism and approximate embedding have different quantifiers."},"assessment":{"zh":"檢查完備化、可分性、正常性及跡保持；有限矩陣近似不直接證明無窮代數同構。","en":"Check completion, separability, normality and trace preservation. Finite-matrix approximations do not directly establish infinite-algebra isomorphism."},"applications":{"zh":"量子資訊與多體統計具有既有連結；由分類結果到可行量子演算法需另外構造。","en":"There are established links to quantum information and many-body statistics; classification results need additional constructions for viable algorithms."}},{"id":4,"name":{"zh":"拓樸","en":"Topology"},"prerequisites":{"zh":"連續映射與基本幾何 → 基本群、同調 → 流形與同倫。","en":"Continuous maps and geometry → fundamental groups and homology → manifolds and homotopy."},"example":{"zh":"圓周上繞一圈不能在圓周內連續縮成一點；實心圓盤內可以。研究的是允許變形下保留的資訊。","en":"A loop winding around a circle cannot contract within the circle, but can within a disk. Topology studies what allowed deformations preserve."},"formal":{"zh":"分清同胚、微分同胚、同倫等價；四維與高維結論不能直接互換。","en":"Distinguish homeomorphism, diffeomorphism and homotopy equivalence; four-dimensional and higher-dimensional results are not interchangeable."},"assessment":{"zh":"核對緊緻性、定向、局部平坦及基本群假設；同調相同遠弱於空間同構。","en":"Check compactness, orientation, local flatness and fundamental-group assumptions; identical homology is much weaker than equivalence of spaces."},"applications":{"zh":"拓樸資料分析與拓樸相已有應用；本批流形分類或反例通常是理論基礎，非現成資料演算法。","en":"Topological data analysis and topological phases are established applications; new manifold results are usually foundations rather than ready-made data algorithms."}},{"id":11,"name":{"zh":"泛函分析","en":"Functional analysis"},"prerequisites":{"zh":"線性代數、級數與積分 → 範數空間、完備性 → 算子、對偶與弱收斂。","en":"Linear algebra, series and integration → normed spaces and completeness → operators, duality and weak convergence."},"example":{"zh":"在 ℓ² 中，標準基底 eₙ 的範數都為 1，但 eₙ 弱收斂至 0；弱收斂不保證範數收斂。","en":"In ℓ², every basis vector eₙ has norm 1, yet eₙ converges weakly to 0. Weak convergence need not imply norm convergence."},"formal":{"zh":"先問使用 Banach 或 Hilbert 結構、哪一種算子範數與哪個緊緻性；這些決定可用定理。","en":"Identify Banach versus Hilbert structure, operator norms and compactness notions before applying a theorem."},"assessment":{"zh":"檢查有界性與一致有界性、定義域稠密性及閉圖條件；有限維直覺常在此失效。","en":"Check boundedness versus uniform boundedness, dense domains and closed-graph hypotheses; finite-dimensional intuition often fails here."},"applications":{"zh":"支援 PDE 弱解、逆問題、核方法與最佳化；數值穩定性仍需離散化誤差分析。","en":"Applications include weak PDE solutions, inverse problems, kernel methods and optimization; numerical stability still requires discretization analysis."}},{"id":7,"name":{"zh":"微分幾何","en":"Differential geometry"},"prerequisites":{"zh":"多變量微積分 → 曲線曲面與張量 → 曲率、測地線和幾何分析。","en":"Multivariable calculus → curves, surfaces and tensors → curvature, geodesics and geometric analysis."},"example":{"zh":"半徑 R 的球面高斯曲率為 1/R²；縮放幾何時面積變 R²、曲率反比變化，提醒定理需尺度一致。","en":"A sphere of radius R has Gaussian curvature 1/R²; area scales like R² while curvature scales inversely, illustrating dimensional consistency."},"formal":{"zh":"分清截面曲率、Ricci 曲率與純量曲率，以及完備、緊緻、單連通。","en":"Distinguish sectional, Ricci and scalar curvature, and completeness, compactness and simple connectivity."},"assessment":{"zh":"檢查奇點、邊界及等號剛性；局部曲率界不能未經論證轉成所有全域結論。","en":"Check singularities, boundaries and equality rigidity; local curvature control does not imply arbitrary global conclusions."},"applications":{"zh":"可連結廣義相對論、曲面重建與幾何最佳化；工程應用須確認採用相同度量與邊界條件。","en":"Connections include general relativity, surface reconstruction and geometric optimization, with the same metric and boundary assumptions required."}},{"id":9,"name":{"zh":"偏微分方程","en":"Partial differential equations"},"prerequisites":{"zh":"微積分、ODE 與 Fourier 級數 → Sobolev 空間與能量法 → 非線性、正則性與緊緻性。","en":"Calculus, ODE and Fourier series → Sobolev spaces and energy methods → nonlinearity, regularity and compactness."},"example":{"zh":"自由輸運 ∂t f+v·∇x f=0 的解是 f(t,x,v)=f₀(x−tv,v)。沿特徵線 f 不變；耦合場則使特徵線本身未知。","en":"Free transport ∂t f+v·∇x f=0 has solution f(t,x,v)=f₀(x−tv,v). The density is constant along characteristics; a coupled field makes those characteristics unknown."},"formal":{"zh":"分開存在、唯一、正則、穩定與散射；弱解存在不是光滑解全域存在。","en":"Separate existence, uniqueness, regularity, stability and scattering. Global weak existence is not global smooth existence."},"assessment":{"zh":"檢查初值相容條件、能量空間、先驗界及延拓準則；每個有限 T 的界不代表對 T 一致有界。","en":"Check initial compatibility, energy spaces, a priori bounds and continuation criteria. Bounds on each finite T need not be uniform in T."},"applications":{"zh":"家族 362 提供電漿 PDE 的導讀；定理不等於穩定的 PIC 求解器，更不直接證明真實裝置的可控性。","en":"Family 362 introduces plasma PDE. A theorem is not a stable particle-in-cell solver and does not directly prove controllability of a physical device."}}],"deepDives":[{"familyId":"017","paperId":"017-01","title":{"zh":"π 的無理性指數：近似得多好才算異常？","en":"The irrationality exponent of π: how good is exceptionally good?"},"claim":{"zh":"論文主張 μ(π)=2：每個 ν>2 都有 Q(ν)，當 q≥Q(ν) 時，所有整數 p 皆滿足 |π−p/q|≥q^(−ν)。因此主張 Flint–Hills 級數 Σ1/(n³ sin²n) 收斂，角度使用弧度。這不是「π 的小數永遠不能高精度計算」。","en":"The manuscript claims μ(π)=2: for every ν>2 there is Q(ν) such that |π−p/q|≥q^(−ν) for every integer p and q≥Q(ν). It derives convergence of the Flint–Hills series Σ1/(n³ sin²n), with radians. This does not limit high-precision computation of π."},"hypotheses":{"zh":"分母為正整數，且門檻依 ν 而異；文中明言門檻非有效給出。指數等於 2 不等於存在統一 c>0 使所有誤差≥c/q²，也不等於連分數部分商有界。","en":"Denominators are positive integers and the threshold depends on ν; the manuscript explicitly does not make it effective. Exponent two is weaker than a uniform c/q² lower bound and does not imply bounded continued-fraction partial quotients."},"why":{"zh":"鴿籠原理已給任意無理數 μ≥2；困難在排除無窮多個比 q^(−2−ε) 更好的近似。若成立，這把 π 放在最小可能的無理性指數，並控制 sin n 極小值出現的稀疏程度。","en":"The pigeonhole principle already gives μ≥2 for any irrational number. The difficulty is excluding infinitely many approximations better than q^(−2−ε). If correct, this places π at the minimum possible exponent and controls how sparsely extremely small sin n values occur."},"roadmap":{"zh":"先假設有無窮多個異常近似，依序挑選間隔極大的分母。多變量插值在對數曲線附近產生非零行列式；清除分母給算術下界。再用 Taylor 次數碰撞與近似誤差給過小的解析上界，造成矛盾。最後以二進區間分組及間距估計推導級數收斂。","en":"Assume infinitely many exceptional approximations and choose widely separated denominators. Multivariable interpolation near logarithmic curves produces a nonzero determinant; clearing denominators gives an arithmetic lower bound. Taylor-degree collisions and approximation errors force an incompatible analytic upper bound. Dyadic grouping and spacing estimates then give series convergence."},"example":{"zh":"22/7 的誤差約 1.264×10⁻³；355/113 的誤差約 2.668×10⁻⁷，比 113⁻²≈7.83×10⁻⁵ 小很多。這個單一例子不違反主張，因 Q(ν) 可很大。練習：列出前 20 個連分數收斂分數，畫 log(error) 對 log(q)，只把圖當有限數值觀察。","en":"The error of 22/7 is about 1.264×10⁻³; that of 355/113 is about 2.668×10⁻⁷, much smaller than 113⁻²≈7.83×10⁻⁵. A single example does not contradict an eventual bound with a large Q(ν). Exercise: plot log(error) against log(q) for 20 continued-fraction convergents; treat it only as finite evidence."},"paths":{"zh":"入門：連分數與 Dirichlet 近似；進階：超越數論、插值行列式。可探索小分母振盪級數的收斂判準；由於門檻無效，不宜宣稱已得到實務最佳誤差常數或更快的 π 計算器。","en":"Start with continued fractions and Dirichlet approximation, then transcendence theory and interpolation determinants. A possible application is convergence criteria for oscillatory small-denominator series; an ineffective threshold does not yield practical best constants or a faster π calculator."},"assessment":{"zh":"最關鍵核對點是插值定理的滿秩性及門檻不依賴中心位置，因單純維度計數不足；再查參數選擇是否循環。此導讀讀過引言和主定理，未獨立核驗全證明或 Lean。","en":"The key audit points are full rank in the interpolation theorem and thresholds independent of center locations: dimension counting alone is insufficient. Check for circular parameter choices. This guide reads the introduction and main statement; it does not independently verify the proof or Lean."},"sources":[{"label":"main.tex","path":"preprints/The-irrationality-exponent-of-pi-is-2-September-24-2026/build/main.tex","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/The-irrationality-exponent-of-pi-is-2-September-24-2026/build/main.tex","locator":"Introduction; Theorem thm:main; Corollary thm:flinthills; The proof in outline"}],"pdf":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/The-irrationality-exponent-of-pi-is-2-September-24-2026/paper.pdf","status":"source-read-not-independently-verified"},{"familyId":"003","paperId":"003-01","title":{"zh":"準黎曼假設與無零半平面","en":"The quasi-Riemann hypothesis and a zero-free half-plane"},"claim":{"zh":"論文主張所有 Dirichlet L 函數及 Q(√−3) 上有限階 Hecke L 函數，在 Re(s)>7/8 無零點，允許主特徵在 s=1 有極點。它沒有宣稱全部非平凡零點位於 Re(s)=1/2。","en":"The manuscript claims that all Dirichlet L-functions and finite-order Hecke L-functions over Q(√−3) have no zeros for Re(s)>7/8, allowing the principal pole at s=1. It does not place all nontrivial zeros on Re(s)=1/2."},"hypotheses":{"zh":"半平面不含邊界 Re(s)=7/8。界線必須對特徵、導子與虛部高度一致；固定特徵的常數或起始門檻則可依該特徵而異。L 級數在 Re(s)>1 之外指的是解析延拓。","en":"The boundary Re(s)=7/8 is excluded. The boundary must be uniform in character, conductor and height, although constants and starting thresholds for a fixed character may depend on it. Outside Re(s)>1, L denotes its analytic continuation."},"why":{"zh":"ζ(s) 的零點控制質數分布誤差。已知的趨近 Re(s)=1 的無零區域，與固定寬度半平面是不同強度；零密度估計也可能允許少量例外零點。此主張若成立，跨越的正是這個差別。","en":"Zeros of ζ(s) govern prime-distribution errors. Classical regions that approach Re(s)=1 differ from a fixed-width half-plane, and a density estimate can still permit exceptional zeros. The claimed advance is a uniform exclusion rather than a count of rare zeros."},"roadmap":{"zh":"證明先比較同一完成立方 theta 和的反射表示與 Poisson 表示，得到 11/12 無零區域；再加入質數補償、不對稱尺度與兩類矩估計，推到 7/8。Poisson 主列中出現目標 1/L 的 Mellin 訊號，解析延拓原理排除其極點；最後透過範數特徵與二次分解傳回 Dirichlet L 函數。","en":"The proposed proof first compares reflected and Poisson representations of a completed cubic-theta sum to obtain 11/12, then introduces prime compensation, asymmetric scales and two moment estimates to reach 7/8. The principal Poisson row contains a Mellin signal involving 1/L; continuation rules out its poles. Norm characters and quadratic factorization transfer the result to Dirichlet L-functions."},"example":{"zh":"以模 5 為例，非零平方餘數為 1、4，所以 2 是非平方餘數。對較大質數 p，逐個測試到找到非平方餘數總會停止，但最壞時間是否為 log p 的多項式，需要額外數論界。原文推得 n(p)≤C(log p)^A，再把這個界接到 Tonelli–Shanks；小例子只展示演算法用途。","en":"Modulo 5, the nonzero quadratic residues are 1 and 4, so 2 is a nonresidue. For a large prime p, sequential testing eventually finds a nonresidue; a worst-case polynomial bound in log p needs extra number theory. The paper derives n(p)≤C(log p)^A and combines it with Tonelli–Shanks. The small example illustrates the application, not the zero-free proof."},"paths":{"zh":"入門：Euler 乘積、複變數與特徵正交；進階：Hecke L 函數、Mellin 變換與大篩。文中具體衍生方向是確定性有限域平方根；不要把它寫成 RH、GRH 或密碼學全面解決。","en":"Learn Euler products, complex analysis and character orthogonality, then Hecke L-functions, Mellin transforms and large sieves. A stated consequence concerns deterministic finite-field square roots; it is not RH, GRH or a general cryptographic breakthrough."},"assessment":{"zh":"應核對兩階段使用的和並不相同、Euler 因子零點、主極點殘數與均勻指數餘量。本導讀不以 README 的形式化比例當作本定理已獨立確認。","en":"Audit the distinct sums in the two stages, omitted Euler factors, principal residues and uniform exponent margins. The repository’s overall formalization percentage is not independent confirmation of this theorem."},"sources":[{"label":"paper.tex","path":"preprints/The-Quasi-Riemann-Hypothesis-September-30-2026/build/paper.tex","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/The-Quasi-Riemann-Hypothesis-September-30-2026/build/paper.tex","locator":"Introduction; Theorem thm:main; Proof overview; Corollary cor:nonresidues-square-roots"}],"pdf":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/The-Quasi-Riemann-Hypothesis-September-30-2026/paper.pdf","status":"source-read-not-independently-verified"},{"familyId":"002","paperId":"002-01","title":{"zh":"低 Selmer 餘秩下的完整 BSD 公式","en":"The full BSD formula under low Selmer corank"},"claim":{"zh":"論文主張：若 E/ℚ 的完整 q 次冪 Selmer 群對某個質數 q 的 ℤq 餘秩為 0 或 1，則 Mordell–Weil 秩、解析秩與該餘秩相等，Sha 有限，並滿足完整 BSD 首項公式 L⁽ʳ⁾(E,1)/r! = ΩE RegE #Sha ∏cℓ / #E(ℚ)tors²。","en":"The manuscript claims that if the full q-power Selmer group of E/ℚ has ℤq-corank 0 or 1 for some prime q, then the Mordell–Weil rank, analytic rank and that corank agree, Sha is finite, and the complete BSD leading-term formula holds: L⁽ʳ⁾(E,1)/r! = ΩE RegE #Sha ∏cℓ / #E(ℚ)tors²."},"hypotheses":{"zh":"關鍵是「完整 Selmer 餘秩≤1」，不能偷換成只知道有理點秩≤1。L 使用所有有限 Euler 因子；ΩE 對全部實點連通分支積分；RegE 使用全文指定的高度正規化。","en":"The hypothesis is low full Selmer corank, not merely low rational-point rank. L includes all finite Euler factors, ΩE integrates over every real component, and RegE uses the paper’s stated height normalization."},"why":{"zh":"秩公式只告訴有多少獨立無限階有理點；首項公式還追蹤 torsion、局部 Tamagawa 數、點格子的體積與局部可解但全域受阻的 Sha。這些有限因子是本篇的焦點。","en":"Rank predicts how many independent infinite-order rational points exist. The leading coefficient also records torsion, local Tamagawa numbers, the volume of the point lattice and Sha’s local-to-global obstruction. These finite factors are the focus here."},"roadmap":{"zh":"先引用同系列的低餘秩反向定理與二主要部分公式。對每個奇質數 p 定義公式差額 Xp(E)，先證 Xp(E)≥0；再挑二次扭曲 Eᴰ，證 Xp(E)+Xp(Eᴰ)=0。兩個非負數和為零迫使精確等式。困難在整數行列式格、theta 比較與排除商的因子，而不是只在分式域中消去。","en":"The proof first uses companion low-corank converse and two-primary formulas. For each odd p it defines a valuation discrepancy Xp(E), proves Xp(E)≥0, and chooses a quadratic twist with Xp(E)+Xp(Eᴰ)=0. Nonnegativity forces equality. The difficult work is integral determinant lattices, theta comparisons and removal of quotient divisors, not cancellation in a fraction field."},"example":{"zh":"在 E:y²=x³−x 上，(0,0)、(1,0)、(−1,0) 都是二階 torsion 點，連同無窮遠點形成 4 個可直接看見的點。這只展示分母中的 torsion 因子；不能由這 4 點直接讀出解析秩、Sha 或完整 BSD。可用 SageMath 計算已知不變量，再逐項比較同一正規化。","en":"On E:y²=x³−x, (0,0), (1,0) and (−1,0) are points of order two, alongside the identity at infinity. They illustrate the torsion factor; these points alone do not determine analytic rank, Sha or BSD. Use SageMath to compute known invariants and compare them under a consistent normalization."},"paths":{"zh":"入門：橢圓曲線群律與有理點；進階：Selmer 群、Galois 上同調、Iwasawa 理論。可研究經認證的曲線資料庫與二次扭曲，但此假設並未涵蓋所有高秩曲線，也不提供離散對數破解法。","en":"Start with the elliptic-curve group law and rational points, then Selmer groups, Galois cohomology and Iwasawa theory. Potential directions include certified curve databases and twists; the scope excludes unrestricted high rank and gives no discrete-logarithm attack."},"assessment":{"zh":"需要連同 companion 論文一起核對；特別是整數商為單位的步驟與實週期／高度的倍數。此處僅解讀主定理與路線，未驗算所有算術依賴。","en":"Audit the companion papers as dependencies, especially unit arguments for integral quotients and period/height normalization factors. This guide explains the main statement and route without verifying every arithmetic dependency."},"sources":[{"label":"sections/01-introduction.tex","path":"preprints/Exact-Birch-Swinnerton-Dyer-Formula-from-Low-Selmer-Corank-October-7-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/Exact-Birch-Swinnerton-Dyer-Formula-from-Low-Selmer-Corank-October-7-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex","locator":"Statement and normalization; Theorem thm:main; The arithmetic discrepancy; Integral comparisons"}],"pdf":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/Exact-Birch-Swinnerton-Dyer-Formula-from-Low-Selmer-Corank-October-7-2026/exact-bsd-low-selmer-corank.pdf","status":"source-read-not-independently-verified"},{"familyId":"221","paperId":"221-01","title":{"zh":"稀疏自旋玻璃：階層空穴公式到底計算什麼？","en":"Diluted spin glasses: what does the hierarchical cavity formula compute?"},"claim":{"zh":"論文主張 Poisson 稀釋、偶數體 Ising 模型在指定 Panchenko–Talagrand 類別中，quenched pressure 的極限 lim N⁻¹E log ZN 等於所有有限階層試探律的變分下確界 infᵣ Φr。","en":"For Poisson-diluted even-arity Ising models in the stated Panchenko–Talagrand class, the manuscript claims that the limiting quenched pressure lim N⁻¹E log ZN equals infᵣ Φr over all finite-depth hierarchical trial laws."},"hypotheses":{"zh":"p 為偶數；交互作用數 M~Poisson(αN)，端點獨立有放回抽樣。需 E max|θ|+E|h|<∞，且 e^θ=a(1+b∏fℓ)、嚴格乘積界與 E(−b)ⁿ≥0 等完整因子化／正性條件。不是所有稀疏 spin glass 的無條件公式。","en":"The arity p is even, M~Poisson(αN), and endpoints are sampled independently with replacement. Assumptions include E max|θ|+E|h|<∞, e^θ=a(1+b∏fℓ), a strict product bound and E(−b)ⁿ≥0, with the full factorization and independence conditions. This is not an unrestricted theorem for every diluted model."},"why":{"zh":"有限平均配位數使局部環境在大 N 仍隨機。單一平均場不足以描述很多競爭態；階層的分布之分布表示不同尺度的局部場不確定性。物理自由能是 −pressure/β，需注意符號與 β 是否吸收進 θ。","en":"Finite mean degree leaves local environments random even as N grows. A hierarchy of distributions of local fields captures competing states beyond a single average field. Physical free energy is −pressure/β; keep track of signs and whether β is absorbed into θ."},"roadmap":{"zh":"已有 interpolation 給階層上界；新關鍵是匹配下界。先在固定有限深度加有界擾動，控制所有有限 multioverlaps；延後分支層級，使平均分支深度下的集中成立。再把空穴插入以有限樹展開，與獨立階層訊息比較。先 N→∞，才讓深度增加；不先假設真實 Gibbs 態超度量。","en":"Earlier interpolation provides hierarchical upper bounds; the claimed new step matches them from below. At fixed depth, bounded perturbations control finite multioverlaps. Delayed branching yields concentration averaged over branching depths. A finite-tree cavity expansion is then compared with independent hierarchical messages. N tends to infinity before depth increases; ultrametric physical Gibbs states are not assumed."},"example":{"zh":"教學極限：兩自旋 H=−Js₁s₂、h=0 時 Z=2e^(βJ)+2e^(−βJ)=4 cosh(βJ)，而 ⟨s₁s₂⟩=tanh(βJ)。零耦合的 N 自旋則 N⁻¹log Z=log 2。這兩項是程式單元檢查，不是該隨機稀疏模型熱力學極限的證明。","en":"For two spins with H=−Js₁s₂ and h=0, Z=4 cosh(βJ), and ⟨s₁s₂⟩=tanh(βJ). For N uncoupled spins, N⁻¹log Z=log 2. These are useful program checks, not proofs of the random diluted thermodynamic limit."},"paths":{"zh":"入門：Ising 配分函數、quenched/annealed；進階：RSB、空穴法與多重重疊。可探索 Viana–Bray、對稱偶數 spin 與 soft even-K SAT 的數值訊息分布。變分下確界不保證有限深度取到，也不保證可在多項式時間最佳化。","en":"Study Ising partition functions and quenched versus annealed averages, then RSB, cavity methods and multioverlaps. Numerical message distributions for Viana–Bray, symmetric even-spin and soft even-K SAT models are possible projects. An infimum need not be attained at finite depth and does not guarantee polynomial-time optimization."},"assessment":{"zh":"查明獨立性在重抽訊息根時是否真的成立、所有 multioverlaps 是否足夠控制、截斷後是否只需一階矩。此頁沒有實際求解完整階層變分問題。","en":"Audit independence when message roots are redrawn, control of all multioverlaps and the removal of truncation under first moments. This page does not solve the full hierarchical optimization problem."},"sources":[{"label":"sections/introduction.tex","path":"preprints/The-Mezard-Parisi-formula-for-diluted-spin-glasses-September-23-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/The-Mezard-Parisi-formula-for-diluted-spin-glasses-September-23-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","locator":"Introduction; final proof-strategy paragraphs"},{"label":"sections/model.tex","path":"preprints/The-Mezard-Parisi-formula-for-diluted-spin-glasses-September-23-2026/build/sections/model.tex","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/The-Mezard-Parisi-formula-for-diluted-spin-glasses-September-23-2026/build/sections/model.tex","locator":"Equations model:integrability–model:positivity; main:theorem"}],"pdf":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/The-Mezard-Parisi-formula-for-diluted-spin-glasses-September-23-2026/paper.pdf","status":"source-read-not-independently-verified"},{"familyId":"271","paperId":"271-01","title":{"zh":"量子鐵磁體：從自發磁化到 Bloch T³ᐟ² 定律","en":"Quantum ferromagnets: spontaneous magnetization and Bloch’s T³ᐟ² law"},"claim":{"zh":"本家族主論文主張，在三維量子 Heisenberg 鐵磁體，固定任意正半整數 spin S，低溫磁化缺額滿足 lim β³ᐟ²(S−m(β))=ζ(3/2)/(8π³ᐟ²√det D)，其中 D=(S/2)Σz J(z)zzᵀ。","en":"The selected main paper claims that for a three-dimensional quantum Heisenberg ferromagnet at every fixed positive half-integer spin S, lim β³ᐟ²(S−m(β))=ζ(3/2)/(8π³ᐟ²√det D), where D=(S/2)Σz J(z)zzᵀ."},"hypotheses":{"zh":"J≥0、J(z)=J(−z)、有限作用範圍，且非零耦合支撐生成 ℤ³。m 是無窮體積 pressure 對 h=0 的右導數。極限順序：體積→∞，再 h↓0，最後 β→∞；不能先在有限盒令 h=0 再讀磁化。","en":"Couplings are nonnegative, symmetric and finite range, and their support generates ℤ³. Magnetization is the right field derivative of infinite-volume pressure at zero. The order is volume→∞, then h↓0, then β→∞; zero-field magnetization of a finite symmetric box is not the same observable."},"why":{"zh":"自旋波理論給出 T³ᐟ² 的直覺，但從近似 magnon 氣體到互動量子自旋的嚴格係數，需要控制場導數。零場自由能的漸近式本身不足以微分得到磁化。此篇也允許空間各向異性的有限範圍耦合。","en":"Spin-wave theory suggests T³ᐟ², but passing from ideal magnons to the interacting quantum spin system requires control of the field derivative. A zero-field free-energy asymptotic alone cannot simply be differentiated to obtain magnetization. The paper also allows spatially anisotropic finite-range couplings."},"roadmap":{"zh":"以 2S 個 spin-1/2 槽表示每個自旋，用 Poisson 交換的有色迴圈與固定向上 pins 表示向下機率。先用子格幾何與 Nash 型估計取得粗界，再控制任意晚的返回；用完整跳躍核比較理想返回機率，以熱核 t^(−3/2) 和 Σn^(−3/2) 找到係數。最後把正場表示為額外 pins 的混合後，依正確次序取極限。","en":"Represent each spin by 2S spin-1/2 slots and use colored Poisson-exchange loops with up-spin pins to express down probabilities. Sublattice geometry and Nash estimates give rough bounds; late returns are controlled and compared with the full ideal jump kernel. Heat-kernel decay t^(−3/2) and Σn^(−3/2) produce the coefficient. A positive field is then represented as additional pins before taking the ordered limits."},"example":{"zh":"最近鄰 J(±ej)=1 時 D=SI。令 S=1/2，係數約 0.166（ħ=kB=格距=耦合尺度=1）。若 T=0.01，領先項預測 S−m≈1.66×10⁻⁴；這是漸近近似而非帶有限溫度誤差認證的數值。積分 ∫d³k/(2π)³[e^(βS|k|²)−1]⁻¹ 換元 k→k/√(βS)，即可看出 β^(−3/2)。","en":"For nearest-neighbor J(±ej)=1, D=SI. At S=1/2 the coefficient is about 0.166 in the stated units. At T=0.01, the leading term predicts S−m≈1.66×10⁻⁴; this is an asymptotic estimate without a certified finite-temperature error. Rescaling k in ∫d³k/(2π)³[e^(βS|k|²)−1]⁻¹ explains the β^(−3/2) power."},"paths":{"zh":"與您的 spin transport 背景相關：可研究 anisotropic D、磁化溫度律與 magnon 有效模型。由平衡磁化到自旋輸運係數仍需動力學與散射理論；此定理沒有直接給 conductivity 或器件效能。","en":"For spin-transport research, useful directions are anisotropic D, magnetization laws and effective magnons. Transport coefficients still need dynamics and scattering theory; this equilibrium theorem does not directly provide conductivity or device performance."},"assessment":{"zh":"需核對 pin 估計是否對額外限制一致、重複環境中的長時間返回，以及壓力差分界能否通過 h↓0。本導讀未獨立證實這些技術引理。","en":"Audit uniformity under extra pins, late returns in a repeated environment and passage of pressure-increment bounds through h↓0. The technical lemmas have not been independently verified here."},"sources":[{"label":"sections/01-introduction.tex","path":"preprints/Blochs-Law-for-Finite-Range-Heisenberg-Ferromagnets-in-Three-Dimensions-October-5-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/Blochs-Law-for-Finite-Range-Heisenberg-Ferromagnets-in-Three-Dimensions-October-5-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex","locator":"Model and result; thm:main; How returns determine the coefficient"}],"pdf":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/Blochs-Law-for-Finite-Range-Heisenberg-Ferromagnets-in-Three-Dimensions-October-5-2026/bloch-law-heisenberg.pdf","status":"source-read-not-independently-verified"},{"familyId":"362","paperId":"362-01","title":{"zh":"相對論 Vlasov–Maxwell：粒子與場會不會有限時間失去光滑？","en":"Relativistic Vlasov–Maxwell: can particles and fields lose smoothness in finite time?"},"claim":{"zh":"論文主張三空間加三動量維、單物種、無背景電荷的相對論 Vlasov–Maxwell 系統，任意平滑相容大初值都有唯一全域古典解，且每個有限時間區間保持光滑與粒子相空間緊支撐。","en":"The manuscript claims unique global classical solutions for arbitrary smooth compatible large data in the three-space/three-momentum-dimensional, one-species relativistic Vlasov–Maxwell system without background charge, retaining smoothness and compact particle phase-space support on every finite interval."},"hypotheses":{"zh":"f₀≥0 且 f₀∈C∞c(ℝ⁶)；E₀、B₀∈C∞b∩L²，所有空間導數有界；div E₀=∫f₀dv、div B₀=0。允許非零總電荷的 Coulomb 尾端，不要求全部場導數皆平方可積。","en":"Assumptions are f₀≥0 with f₀∈C∞c(ℝ⁶), E₀,B₀∈C∞b∩L² with all spatial derivatives bounded, div E₀=∫f₀dv and div B₀=0. Nonzero total charge and a Coulomb tail are allowed; all field derivatives need not be square-integrable."},"why":{"zh":"大初值的全域弱解、局部古典解和全域光滑唯一解是不同層級。這裡 u(v)=v/√(1+|v|²) 的速率小於光速，但動量仍可能增大；僅「速度有上界」不能證明正則性。","en":"Global weak existence, local classical existence and unique global smooth evolution are distinct. The velocity u(v)=v/√(1+|v|²) is subluminal, but momentum may grow without bound; bounded speed alone does not prove regularity."},"roadmap":{"zh":"核心是沿特徵線估計有符號衝量 ∫(E+u×B)dt，而非先取力的絕對值。把來源粒子與後向光錐交會按動量、距離、角度分組；近共線區利用延遲力的消去與分部積分，再控制方向改變與停留時間。得到每次動量加倍所需時間的下界，其總和發散；因此動量不能有限時間爆炸，最後套用延拓準則。","en":"The central estimate controls signed impulse ∫(E+u×B)dt along characteristics before taking absolute values. Source intersections with backward light cones are grouped by momentum, distance and angles. Near-collinear retarded-force cancellation and integration by parts are combined with direction-change and occupation bounds. Lower bounds on momentum-doubling times have divergent sum, preventing finite-time momentum blow-up and enabling continuation."},"example":{"zh":"教學模型是無自洽力的自由輸運 f(t,x,v)=f₀(x−tu(v),v)，可直接代入 PDE 驗證。若 f₀≠0，任意把完整系統 E=B=0 會違反 div E=ρ；所以自由輸運只作拆解練習，並非此帶電系統的非零密度精確解。","en":"The teaching model is force-free transport f(t,x,v)=f₀(x−tu(v),v), verified by direct differentiation. If f₀≠0, setting E=B=0 in the coupled system generally violates div E=ρ. Thus free transport is a decoupled exercise, not a nonzero-density exact solution of the charged system."},"paths":{"zh":"入門：輸運、Lorentz 力、Maxwell 相容條件；進階：光錐能量、bootstrap 與延拓。可研究保電荷 PIC 方法與誤差比較；正則性主張不給時間一致界、不保證散射，也不等同核融合裝置性能。","en":"Study transport, Lorentz force and Maxwell constraints, then light-cone energy, bootstrap and continuation. Possible applications include charge-conserving particle-in-cell analysis. Regularity does not supply uniform-in-time bounds, scattering or fusion-device performance."},"assessment":{"zh":"最需檢查的是有符號消去後含接收粒子加速度的項能否吸收，以及更強停留界是否先於其使用得到。此處未重做完整 PDE 證明。","en":"The critical checks are absorption of the receiver-acceleration term after signed cancellation and whether improved occupation bounds are established before they are used. The full PDE proof has not been independently reproduced."},"sources":[{"label":"sections/introduction.tex","path":"preprints/Global-classical-solutions-of-the-three-dimensional-relativistic-Vlasov-Maxwell-system-September-23-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/Global-classical-solutions-of-the-three-dimensional-relativistic-Vlasov-Maxwell-system-September-23-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","locator":"Equations eq:rvm, eq:data; thm:global; Proof strategy"}],"pdf":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/Global-classical-solutions-of-the-three-dimensional-relativistic-Vlasov-Maxwell-system-September-23-2026/paper.pdf","status":"source-read-not-independently-verified"},{"familyId":"102","paperId":"102-01","title":{"zh":"Unique Games 與近似最佳化的極限","en":"Unique Games and the limits of approximation"},"claim":{"zh":"論文主張對每個固定 ε,δ∈(0,1/2)，可由 3SAT 在確定性多項式時間歸約至固定有限字母表的 Unique Games：可滿足時 value≥1−ε，不可滿足時 value≤δ。圖為簡單二分圖，限制為 ℱ₂ˢ 上的平移。","en":"The manuscript claims that for every fixed ε,δ∈(0,1/2), a deterministic polynomial-time reduction maps 3SAT to Unique Games over a fixed finite alphabet, with value≥1−ε in the satisfiable case and value≤δ otherwise. The graph is simple bipartite and constraints are translations over ℱ₂ˢ."},"hypotheses":{"zh":"先固定兩個誤差，才選字母表；字母表大小與多項式次數可依 ε、δ 而異。限制逐條顯式列出且未加權。NP 困難性不等於已證 P≠NP。","en":"The two errors are fixed before choosing the alphabet; alphabet size and polynomial degree may depend on them. Constraints are explicit and unweighted. NP-hardness is not a proof that P≠NP."},"why":{"zh":"許多 SDP 近似門檻原本以 Unique Games 為假設。此主張若成立，可經既有歸約去除那些結果的這一假設；但最壞情形困難性不否定特定物理或產業實例有好演算法。","en":"Many semidefinite approximation thresholds were conditional on Unique Games. If correct, this result removes that hypothesis through existing reductions. Worst-case hardness does not rule out effective algorithms for structured physical or industrial instances."},"roadmap":{"zh":"從幾乎可滿足的三變數 parity 問題出發，建立非線性 latent-noise gadget：合法編碼對噪音穩定，但足夠高秩的線性觀測能偵測噪音。高通過率迫使低秩 Fourier 質量，再用 matrix-shortcode 反向定理抽取局部答案。稀疏提問和 clean coordinates 將其送入 parallel repetition，與 NO 實例的低一致率矛盾。","en":"Starting from nearly satisfiable three-variable parity, a nonlinear latent-noise gadget keeps valid encodings stable while high-rank linear observations detect the noise. High test acceptance forces low-rank Fourier mass; the matrix-shortcode inverse theorem extracts local answers. Sparse questions and clean coordinates lead to parallel repetition, contradicting low agreement for NO instances."},"example":{"zh":"三個二元變數限制 x₂=x₁、x₃=x₂、x₁=x₃+1 mod 2，三式相加產生 0=1，因此最多滿足 2/3。這只是小型置換約束例子，不是論文的簡單二分歸約輸出。再比較三角形 Max-Cut=2，學會區分約束 value 和近似比。","en":"For binary variables, x₂=x₁, x₃=x₂ and x₁=x₃+1 mod 2 cannot all hold: summation gives 0=1, so at most 2/3 are satisfied. This illustrates permutation constraints, not the paper’s simple bipartite reduction. Compare a triangle’s Max-Cut value 2 to distinguish constraint value from approximation ratio."},"paths":{"zh":"入門：SAT、圖切割與 SDP；進階：PCP、Fourier 分析、歸約量詞。可用於決定採精確求解、近似或結構假設；不能把 theorem 變成一鍵求解所有 NP 困難問題的功能。","en":"Study SAT, graph cuts and SDP, then PCP, Fourier analysis and reduction quantifiers. These ideas guide choices between exact algorithms, approximation and structural assumptions; they do not yield a one-click solver for NP-hard problems."},"assessment":{"zh":"重點是完整性接近 1 與 soundness 任意小能否同時成立、抽取器是否只用其可見資訊、條件化後 clean 提問的獨立性，以及最終輸出大小。僅 integrality gap 不能代替此核驗。","en":"Audit simultaneous near-one completeness and arbitrarily small soundness, information available to each decoder, conditional independence of clean questions and final output size. An integrality gap does not replace this audit."},"sources":[{"label":"sections/00-introduction.tex","path":"preprints/The-Unique-Games-Theorem-September-23-2026/build/sections/00-introduction.tex","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/The-Unique-Games-Theorem-September-23-2026/build/sections/00-introduction.tex","locator":"Theorem thm:ugc; Proofs, codes, and the quantifiers; The construction and proof"}],"pdf":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/The-Unique-Games-Theorem-September-23-2026/paper.pdf","status":"source-read-not-independently-verified"},{"familyId":"159","paperId":"159-01","title":{"zh":"稀疏整數集合中的長等差級數","en":"Long arithmetic progressions inside sparse integer sets"},"claim":{"zh":"論文主張每個固定 k≥3，都有 Ck,ck,εk>0，使沒有非恆定 k 項等差級數的 [N] 子集至多 Ck N exp[−ck(log N)^εk] 個元素；因此任何倒數和發散的正整數集包含任意有限長度的等差級數。","en":"For every fixed k≥3, the manuscript claims rₖ(N)≤Ck N exp[−ck(log N)^εk], where rₖ(N) is the largest progression-free subset of [N]. It follows that every positive-integer set with divergent reciprocal sum contains arithmetic progressions of every finite length."},"hypotheses":{"zh":"公差必須大於零；k 固定後常數才固定。不能把定理讀成一組常數同時控制所有 k。本文不聲稱改善三項級數的最佳指數；關鍵是所有固定長度的可求和界。","en":"The common difference is positive, and constants are fixed only after k is fixed. This is not a single uniform bound for all k. The claimed advance is a summable bound at every fixed length, not an improvement of the best three-term exponent."},"why":{"zh":"正密度的 Szemerédi 結論只需 rₖ(N)=o(N)；倒數和發散允許零密度集合，所以需要更強的量化衰減。此論文把密度增量的次數、座標數與精度損失同時控制。","en":"Positive-density Szemerédi requires only rₖ(N)=o(N), whereas divergent reciprocal sums allow zero-density sets. A stronger quantitative decay is needed. The proposed argument controls the number of density increments, coordinates and precision losses together."},"roadmap":{"zh":"沒有級數會迫使高階均勻範數大，經逆定理找到 nilsequence 結構與密度增量。以 triangular polynomial cells 保留舊整數約束，新增高權重到低權重的精度預算遞推，讓總 log 長度損失只多項式成長。密度不可能無限增加，於是推出 rₖ 的界。","en":"Absence of progressions forces higher-order structure, detected through inverse theorems and nilsequences, leading to density increments. Triangular polynomial cells preserve previous integer constraints while descending precision budgets control new losses. Total logarithmic length loss remains polynomial; density cannot increase indefinitely, giving the bound."},"example":{"zh":"可完整驗算一個後果：若 A 不含 k 項級數，則在 [2ᵐ,2ᵐ⁺¹) 中 Σ1/a≤2^(−m)rₖ(2ᵐ)≤C exp[−c(m log2)^ε]。因 m^ε/log m→∞，後者最終≤m⁻²，跨所有 m 求和有限。其逆否命題就是倒數和發散必有級數。這是依賴主界的有效教學推導。","en":"One consequence can be checked fully: if A has no k-term progression, then on [2ᵐ,2ᵐ⁺¹), Σ1/a≤2^(−m)rₖ(2ᵐ)≤C exp[−c(m log2)^ε]. Since m^ε/log m→∞, the latter is eventually at most m⁻²; summation is finite. The contrapositive gives the reciprocal-sum consequence, conditional on the main bound."},"paths":{"zh":"入門：等差計數、Roth 與密度增量；進階：Gowers 範數、nilmanifold。可連結偽隨機性與組合模式偵測；定理的巨大未知常數不保證有限資料中的快速偵測或實用門檻。","en":"Study progression counting, Roth and density increments, then Gowers norms and nilmanifolds. Connections include pseudorandomness and pattern detection; large unspecified constants do not guarantee practical finite-data thresholds."},"assessment":{"zh":"應核對舊 cell 約束是否完全保留、常數是否只依固定 k、精度遞推有無同層自我依賴，以及外部逆定理的適用範圍。上面的 dyadic 後果可驗算，主增量定理未在此重證。","en":"Audit preservation of old cell equations, dependence only on fixed k, absence of same-level circular precision bounds and the scope of external inverse theorems. The dyadic consequence is elementary; the main increment theorem is not re-proved here."},"sources":[{"label":"sections/00-introduction.tex","path":"preprints/Quasipolynomial-Bounds-for-Arithmetic-Progressions-September-23-2026/build/sections/00-introduction.tex","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/Quasipolynomial-Bounds-for-Arithmetic-Progressions-September-23-2026/build/sections/00-introduction.tex","locator":"Theorem ap:main; Corollary ap:reciprocal; Preserving structure through density increments"}],"pdf":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/Quasipolynomial-Bounds-for-Arithmetic-Progressions-September-23-2026/paper.pdf","status":"source-read-not-independently-verified"},{"familyId":"107","paperId":"107-01","title":{"zh":"矩陣乘法指數 9/4：理論加速和實務效能","en":"Matrix multiplication exponent 9/4: theory versus finite-size performance"},"claim":{"zh":"論文主張複數域上的矩陣乘法指數 ω≤9/4，即每個 ε>0 都有以 Oε(n^(9/4+ε)) 個純量算術運算計算 n×n 矩陣乘積的演算法。","en":"The paper claims ω≤9/4 over the complex numbers: for every ε>0, n×n matrix multiplication is possible with Oε(n^(9/4+ε)) scalar arithmetic operations."},"hypotheses":{"zh":"這是 n→∞ 的算術複雜度；演算法和常數可依 ε。未提供競爭力的有限 n 起點、GPU 實作、浮點穩定性或位元複雜度保證。","en":"This is asymptotic arithmetic complexity as n→∞; the algorithm and constants may depend on ε. It provides no competitive finite-size crossover, GPU implementation, floating-point stability or bit-complexity guarantee."},"why":{"zh":"標準三重迴圈為 n³，Strassen 遞迴用 7 次 2×2 區塊乘法得 log₂7≈2.807。進一步改善通常要用大型張量退化與漸近提取，故指數更小不一定在筆電上更快。","en":"The standard triple loop costs n³, while Strassen’s seven block products give exponent log₂7≈2.807. Further improvements use tensor degenerations and asymptotic extraction, so a lower exponent need not be faster on a laptop."},"roadmap":{"zh":"文章構造有限 Fourier 投影加權退化，把共用一條張量腿的區塊分離。接著以對直和可加、張量積可乘的 character 測量多項式乘法，建立離散凹性與三倍尺度成長。下界 P(a,a)≥a^(4/3) 對上插值上界，迫使 character 的矩陣乘法參數 t≤3/4，得到 3t≤9/4。","en":"A finite Fourier projection and weighted degeneration separate tensor blocks sharing one leg. Additive and multiplicative tensor characters measure polynomial multiplication; discrete concavity and threefold-scale growth imply P(a,a)≥a^(4/3). Comparing with an interpolation upper bound forces t≤3/4 and hence 3t≤9/4."},"example":{"zh":"例：(a₀+a₁x)(b₀+b₁x) 的係數是 a₀b₀、a₀b₁+a₁b₀、a₁b₁。可用乘積 m₀=a₀b₀、m₂=a₁b₁、m₁=(a₀+a₁)(b₀+b₁)，中項=m₁−m₀−m₂，只需 3 次乘法。這展示雙線性計算的重組，不是 9/4 演算法本身。","en":"For (a₀+a₁x)(b₀+b₁x), use m₀=a₀b₀, m₂=a₁b₁ and m₁=(a₀+a₁)(b₀+b₁); the middle coefficient is m₁−m₀−m₂. Three multiplications replace four. This illustrates bilinear reorganization, not the claimed 9/4 algorithm."},"paths":{"zh":"入門：遞迴複雜度與雙線性演算法；進階：張量秩、退化、asymptotic spectrum。未來應用需抽取明確有限構造並測記憶體、通訊與誤差；本網站的矩陣小工具不應宣稱已實作新指數。","en":"Learn recurrence complexity and bilinear algorithms, then tensor rank, degeneration and asymptotic spectra. Applications need explicit finite constructions plus memory, communication and error benchmarks; a small matrix widget must not claim to implement the new exponent."},"assessment":{"zh":"查共享腿分離是否真的得到全直和、輔助 dot product 的成本是否被正確計入、character 存在定理與極限順序。未在此獨立驗證張量不等式。","en":"Audit full direct-sum separation, accounting for auxiliary dot-product costs, the detecting-character theorem and limit order. The tensor inequalities are not independently verified here."},"sources":[{"label":"paper.tex","path":"preprints/Matrix-Multiplication-Nine-Fourths-October-2-2026/build/paper.tex","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/Matrix-Multiplication-Nine-Fourths-October-2-2026/build/paper.tex","locator":"Introduction; thm:main; prop:separation; cor:entropy; Route to the exponent"}],"pdf":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/Matrix-Multiplication-Nine-Fourths-October-2-2026/paper.pdf","status":"source-read-not-independently-verified"},{"familyId":"113","paperId":"113-01","title":{"zh":"完美匹配：找到一組與近似計算有幾組","en":"Perfect matchings: finding one versus approximately counting all"},"claim":{"zh":"論文主張任意有限簡單無向圖的完美匹配數有 FPRAS：以至少 1−δ 的機率輸出相對誤差 ε 內的計數，最壞位元時間為輸入長度、1/ε、log(1/δ) 的多項式；無完美匹配時確定輸出零。","en":"The manuscript claims an FPRAS for perfect matchings of every finite simple undirected graph: relative error ε with success probability at least 1−δ, worst-case bit time polynomial in input length, 1/ε and log(1/δ), and exact zero output when no perfect matching exists."},"hypotheses":{"zh":"輸入 ε、δ 為指定範圍內的有理數。相對誤差不同於加法誤差；近似不是精確 #P 計數。帶顏色平行邊是中間構造，不表示支援任意壓縮多重度輸入。","en":"The error and confidence parameters are rational inputs in the stated ranges. Relative differs from additive error, and approximation is not exact #P counting. Colored parallel edges occur internally and do not imply support for arbitrary compressed multiplicities."},"why":{"zh":"存在一個完美匹配可用經典多項式演算法判定；一般圖有多少個則困難得多。所有匹配總數與只數完美匹配亦不同，後者在抽樣分布中可能非常稀少。","en":"Existence of a perfect matching has a classical polynomial-time algorithm; counting all of them is much harder. Counting all matchings also differs from isolating perfect matchings, which may have tiny sampling mass."},"roadmap":{"zh":"從易計數的完全圖開始，逐步降低非目標邊的活動度，估相鄰配分函數比並相乘。用頂點縮放平衡雙洞比例；擴充圖加入受控弱邊，使真正匹配仍有足夠機率。抽樣器使用多匹配乘積空間與交替圈交換；先證配對能量比較，再以複製與正交分解升級成所有函數的 spectral gap。","en":"Start with an easily counted complete graph, gradually suppress nonedges, estimate successive partition-function ratios and multiply them. Vertex scaling balances two-hole ratios. An enlarged graph adds controlled weak edges while keeping real matchings sufficiently probable. Sampling uses product matching spaces and alternating-cycle exchanges; replication and orthogonal decomposition lift a pair-energy comparison to a full spectral gap."},"example":{"zh":"K₄ 有三個完美匹配：{12,34}、{13,24}、{14,23}；四邊形 C₄ 只有其中兩個。若真值 Z=3、ε=0.1，合格輸出區間是 [2.7,3.3]，且允許最多 δ 的失敗率。輸出不必是整數。","en":"K₄ has three perfect matchings: {12,34}, {13,24} and {14,23}; the cycle C₄ has two. If Z=3 and ε=0.1, an acceptable output lies in [2.7,3.3], with failure probability at most δ. The output need not be an integer."},"paths":{"zh":"入門：matching、配分函數與 Monte Carlo；進階：Markov chain mixing、conductance 與退火。可探索配對配置的熵與抽樣，但論文常數為理論清楚而選，未聲稱實務快速。","en":"Study matchings, partition functions and Monte Carlo, then mixing, conductance and annealing. Applications may involve pairing entropy and sampling, but the paper chooses constants for proof transparency rather than practical speed."},"assessment":{"zh":"查每個階段抽樣分布是否正確、balance 失敗時仍有最壞時間界、相對誤差與整體失敗率累積、以及配對函數估計如何推至任意函數。","en":"Audit sampling laws, worst-case runtime even after inaccurate balance estimates, accumulated relative error and failure probability, and the extension from additive pair functions to arbitrary functions."},"sources":[{"label":"main.tex","path":"preprints/A-Fully-Polynomial-Randomized-Approximation-Scheme-for-Perfect-Matchings-in-General-Graphs-September-23-2026/build/main.tex","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/A-Fully-Polynomial-Randomized-Approximation-Scheme-for-Perfect-Matchings-in-General-Graphs-September-23-2026/build/main.tex","locator":"Introduction; thm:main; Proof architecture; table tab:graph-laws"}],"pdf":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/A-Fully-Polynomial-Randomized-Approximation-Scheme-for-Perfect-Matchings-in-General-Graphs-September-23-2026/main.pdf","status":"source-read-not-independently-verified"},{"familyId":"158","paperId":"158-01","title":{"zh":"平面單位距離著色：為何不是四色定理？","en":"Unit-distance coloring of the plane: why this is not the four-color theorem"},"claim":{"zh":"論文主張任意五色平面著色必有同色、距離恰為 1 的點對；結合已知七色構造，主張 6≤χ(ℝ²)≤7，仍不決定是 6 或 7。","en":"The paper claims that every five-coloring of the plane contains a monochromatic pair at distance exactly one, yielding 6≤χ(ℝ²)≤7 with the classical seven-color construction. It does not decide between six and seven."},"hypotheses":{"zh":"允許任意色類，不加可測或邊界規則性假設；使用 ZFC。圖的邊可交叉，所以它不是地圖四色定理的平面圖問題。","en":"Color classes are arbitrary, without measurability or boundary regularity, in ZFC. Unit-distance edges can cross, so this is not the planar-map four-color problem."},"why":{"zh":"有限單位距離圖可提供下界，但搜不出五色反例不代表整個平面可五色。任意著色與可測著色的差異很大；文章的關鍵之一是建立可使用分析工具的橋樑。","en":"Finite unit-distance graphs provide lower bounds, but failure to find an obstruction does not establish a five-coloring of the entire plane. Arbitrary and measurable colorings differ substantially; the paper’s key step is a bridge permitting analytic tools."},"roadmap":{"zh":"先由任意正確著色導出「幾乎所有位置與方向」排除同色單位點對的弱可測著色。透過 character 空間的譜分解與剛性移除非連續部分，再從色盤轉換抽取共享中心的連通排除集合。五個標籤的簡單循環只可能長 3、4、5；逐一以角度規則、拓樸與 Moser 構型排除。","en":"The proposed transfer turns an arbitrary proper coloring into a weak measurable coloring excluding monochromatic unit pairs for almost all positions and directions. Spectral decomposition and character-space rigidity remove discontinuous components. Palette transitions produce connected exclusion sets sharing a center; cycles on five labels have lengths 3, 4 or 5, each ruled out by angular, topological and Moser-configuration arguments."},"example":{"zh":"等邊三角形三條邊都長 1，故至少要 3 色。這只證 χ≥3，不能拿三角形的 3 色直接塗滿平面。練習：建立有限點集，以 |distance−1|<tol 當邊做探索；正式證明必須用精確距離或認證誤差，不能依任意 tol。","en":"An equilateral unit triangle needs three colors, proving only χ≥3; its coloring does not extend automatically to the plane. Exercise: explore finite point sets using a distance tolerance, but use exact distances or certified error for any proof."},"paths":{"zh":"入門：圖著色與有限構型；進階：測度、調和分析、群作用。可用於距離排斥配置的教學；實際無線頻道常有距離≤r 而非距離恰等於 r，不能直接套用。","en":"Study graph coloring and finite configurations, then measure, harmonic analysis and group actions. This informs exclusion-distance design, but wireless interference usually concerns distance≤r rather than exactly r, so direct application is inappropriate."},"assessment":{"zh":"核對任意到弱可測的轉移是否保留全部排除條件、零測集處理、剛性與拓樸抽取。原文的有限 obstruction 為存在性，這裡沒有生成一個已認證的六色圖。","en":"Audit preservation of exclusions in the measurable transfer, null sets, rigidity and topological extraction. The finite obstruction is existential; no certified six-chromatic graph is generated here."},"sources":[{"label":"sections/introduction.tex","path":"preprints/The-Euclidean-plane-is-not-five-colorable-September-23-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/The-Euclidean-plane-is-not-five-colorable-September-23-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","locator":"thm:main; def:weak-coloring; thm:transfer; proof overview"}],"pdf":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/The-Euclidean-plane-is-not-five-colorable-September-23-2026/paper.pdf","status":"source-read-not-independently-verified"},{"familyId":"179","paperId":"179-01","title":{"zh":"循環 Hadamard 與 Barker 序列：自相關的兩種邊界","en":"Circulant Hadamard matrices and Barker sequences: two autocorrelation boundaries"},"claim":{"zh":"論文主張實循環 Hadamard 矩陣只存在於階數 1、4；結合既有奇數長度定理，推得長度>1 的 Barker ±1 序列只存在於 2、3、4、5、7、11、13。","en":"The manuscript claims real circulant Hadamard matrices exist only at orders 1 and 4. Combined with prior odd-length results, it gives Barker-sequence lengths greater than one exactly 2, 3, 4, 5, 7, 11 and 13."},"hypotheses":{"zh":"Hadamard 條件為 HHᵀ=nI，且每列是同一 ±1 列的循環移位。週期自相關 P(t) 會繞回；Barker 條件用不繞回的非週期自相關 |C(t)|≤1。不能把所有 Hadamard 矩陣都限制為只有 1、4 階。","en":"The matrix has ±1 entries, HHᵀ=nI, and cyclic-shift rows. Periodic autocorrelation wraps around; Barker sequences use nonwrapping aperiodic |C(t)|≤1. The conclusion does not restrict all Hadamard matrices to orders 1 and 4."},"why":{"zh":"短而尖銳的自相關峰利於時間同步與訊號辨識；精確零旁瓣比僅小旁瓣強得多。此結果若正確，排除延長這種特殊二元循環完美設計，並非排除所有近似或複數碼。","en":"Sharp autocorrelation peaks aid synchronization and identification. Exact zero sidelobes are much stronger than small sidelobes. If correct, the result limits this special binary circulant design, not approximate or complex-valued codes."},"roadmap":{"zh":"把首列編成整數群環 h，正交性成為 hh*=n。先推傳統限制 n=4u²、u 奇數，再比較不同質數方向的角色值交替乘積；局部整數性和絕對值把它限制為特殊單位根。最後同一組 ±1 係數在模 2 的關係給出不能同時成立的交替和，迫使 u=1。","en":"Encode the first row as an integral group-ring element h with hh*=n. First derive n=4u² with u odd, then compare alternating products of character evaluations across prime directions. Local integrality and absolute values constrain these products to roots of unity. Modulo-two relations from the same sign coefficients give an incompatible alternating sum, forcing u=1."},"example":{"zh":"h=(1,1,1,−1)：P(1)=1+1−1−1=0、P(2)=1−1+1−1=0、P(3)=0，因此循環列形成 4 階 Hadamard。非週期 C(1)=1、C(2)=0、C(3)=−1，同時滿足 Barker。這個小例子可以完整逐項驗算。","en":"For h=(1,1,1,−1), P(1)=1+1−1−1=0, P(2)=1−1+1−1=0 and P(3)=0, giving a circulant Hadamard matrix of order four. Aperiodic correlations are C(1)=1, C(2)=0 and C(3)=−1, so it is also Barker. Every calculation is directly checkable."},"paths":{"zh":"入門：相關函數與 DFT；進階：循環差集、群環、cyclotomic 整數。可實作碼序列搜尋與脈衝壓縮展示；若追求長序列，應另研究容許小旁瓣、非循環或非二元設計。","en":"Study correlation and the DFT, then cyclic difference sets, group rings and cyclotomic integers. Build code-search or pulse-compression demonstrations; longer designs may permit small sidelobes, noncirculant structure or nonbinary alphabets."},"assessment":{"zh":"核對群環局部下降時的整除性、不同角色值是否來自共同係數，以及模 2 推理沒有把複數單位根當成實數。小例子的驗證不構成全部階數的排除。","en":"Audit divisibility in local descent, common coefficient origins of character values and careful modulo-two treatment of complex roots of unity. Verification of the small example does not prove exclusion at every order."},"sources":[{"label":"sections/introduction.tex","path":"preprints/The-circulant-Hadamard-conjecture-September-23-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/The-circulant-Hadamard-conjecture-September-23-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","locator":"thm:main; cor:barker; Group-ring notation; Proof strategy"}],"pdf":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/The-circulant-Hadamard-conjecture-September-23-2026/paper.pdf","status":"source-read-not-independently-verified"},{"familyId":"266","paperId":"266-01","title":{"zh":"六維互不偏基底：數值搜尋如何升級成證書？","en":"Mutually unbiased bases in dimension six: from numerical search to certificate"},"claim":{"zh":"文章在指定算術與編譯器條件、以及完整執行紀錄成立下，主張 ℂ⁶ 不能有 4 組兩兩互不偏正交基底；加上明確的 3 組構造，得到 N(6)=3。","en":"Under its stated arithmetic/compiler contract and complete execution record, the paper claims there are no four pairwise mutually unbiased orthonormal bases in ℂ⁶; an explicit construction of three yields N(6)=3."},"hypotheses":{"zh":"互不偏指任取跨基底向量，內積絕對值平方恰為 1/6。排除涵蓋任意第二基底，不只 Fourier 家族。結論是計算輔助，需浮點誤差邊界、所有分支覆蓋及無未解記錄。","en":"Mutual unbiasedness means every cross-basis squared overlap is exactly 1/6. Exclusion covers arbitrary second bases, not just the Fourier family. The result is computer-assisted and needs rounding margins, exhaustive coverage and no unresolved records."},"why":{"zh":"量子態若是某基底的確定態，在互不偏基底量測會均勻分布。質數冪維度有完整 d+1 組構造；6=2×3 是首個非質數冪維度，不能直接移用有限域構造。","en":"A state definite in one basis has uniform measurement outcomes in an unbiased basis. Prime-power dimensions admit complete d+1 constructions; six is the first non-prime-power dimension, so those finite-field constructions do not transfer directly."},"roadmap":{"zh":"先將第一基底固定為標準基，第二基底變為複 Hadamard H/√6。用相位 seed、U(2) completion 與經認證的切向／法向界覆蓋所有 H；再為候選互不偏向量建立可能正交與可能互不偏兩張圖。多出兩組基底需要兩個 6-clique 及 36 條跨邊，逐區域排除這個型態。","en":"Fix the first basis to the standard basis and write the second as H/√6 with H complex Hadamard. Phase seeds, U(2) completions and certified tangent/normal bounds cover every H. Candidate unbiased vectors form graphs of possible orthogonality and possible unbiasedness. Two additional bases require two six-cliques and 36 cross-edges; the search excludes this pattern in every region."},"example":{"zh":"在 ℂ²，Z、X、Y 基底互不偏，跨內積平方為 1/2；在 ℂ³ 可選三組互不偏基底，跨平方為 1/3。把同序號基底張量相乘，跨平方變 (1/2)(1/3)=1/6，明確構造 ℂ⁶ 的 3 組。這只給下界，不排除第 4 組。","en":"In ℂ² the Z, X and Y bases have squared cross overlaps 1/2. Choose three unbiased bases in ℂ³ with squared overlaps 1/3. Tensor corresponding bases to obtain three in ℂ⁶, since (1/2)(1/3)=1/6. This establishes the lower bound only, not exclusion of a fourth."},"paths":{"zh":"入門：Born 規則、Hadamard／Fourier 矩陣；進階：區間運算與完備搜尋。可設計量測與 tomography 教具；量測方案的實際抗噪性和硬體可實作性需另分析。","en":"Study the Born rule and Hadamard/Fourier matrices, then interval arithmetic and exhaustive search. Possible applications include measurement and tomography teaching; noise robustness and hardware realization require separate work."},"assessment":{"zh":"原文明言失敗認證或超出搜尋上限必須保留為未解區域，不能當作排除。本交付沒有重跑其完整計算，不能標成「已由本機驗證 N(6)=3」。","en":"The paper explicitly retains failed certifications or exhausted search caps as unresolved regions, never as exclusions. This deliverable does not rerun the complete computation and must not label N(6)=3 as locally verified."},"sources":[{"label":"sections/introduction.tex","path":"preprints/The-maximum-number-of-mutually-unbiased-bases-in-dimension-six-September-24-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/The-maximum-number-of-mutually-unbiased-bases-in-dimension-six-September-24-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","locator":"Computer-assisted thm:main; Covering and exclusion strategy; Elementary lower bound"}],"pdf":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/The-maximum-number-of-mutually-unbiased-bases-in-dimension-six-September-24-2026/The-maximum-number-of-mutually-unbiased-bases-in-dimension-six-September-24-2026.pdf","status":"source-read-not-independently-verified"},{"familyId":"268","paperId":"268-01","title":{"zh":"Spin-1 Haldane gap：有限證書如何控制無限鏈？","en":"The spin-one Haldane gap: how finite certificates control long chains"},"claim":{"zh":"論文主張純雙線性反鐵磁 spin-1 Heisenberg 偶數週期鏈具有均勻正 gap。對偶數 L≥2304，γL>log(20)/784≈0.00382；因而 liminf γL≥該常數。","en":"The paper claims a uniform positive gap for the pure bilinear antiferromagnetic spin-one Heisenberg chain on even periodic rings. For even L≥2304, γL>log(20)/784≈0.00382, hence the same lower bound for liminf γL."},"hypotheses":{"zh":"H=Σj Sj·Sj+1，耦合設為 1，局部空間 ℂ³，週期且 L 偶數。gap 指下一個不同能量減基態能量；L≥60 另主張基態唯一並有較小正界。不應把 AKLT 的雙二次項結果當成此純模型。","en":"The model is H=Σj Sj·Sj+1 with coupling one, local space ℂ³ and even periodic length. The gap is to the next distinct energy; uniqueness and a smaller bound are also claimed for L≥60. An AKLT result with biquadratic terms is not this pure model."},"why":{"zh":"物理與數值早已支持約 0.4105 的 gap；嚴格下界 0.00382 遠小於預測仍有意義，因它排除 gap 隨 L→∞ 消失。有限長鏈各自 gap>0 不足以保證這種一致下界。","en":"Physical and numerical evidence supports a gap around 0.4105. A much smaller rigorous bound of 0.00382 is meaningful because it prevents closure as L→∞. Positive gaps at individual finite lengths do not establish a uniform lower bound."},"roadmap":{"zh":"以同一配分函數的兩種表示建立物理 Boltzmann 權重與自伴空間 transfer operator 的偶數矩。分布 purity 接近 1 代表單一權重占優；平方再正規化會使 purity 缺陷二次縮小。耦合「溫度加倍」與「長度加倍」，從有限熱跡和 matrix-product 試探態證書啟動，藉矩不等式覆蓋中間長度，再把熱權重比轉成能量 gap。","en":"Two representations of the same partition function provide physical Boltzmann weights and even moments of a self-adjoint spatial transfer operator. Purity near one means one weight dominates; squaring and renormalizing quadratically reduces the defect. Coupled doubling of inverse temperature and length starts from finite thermal-trace and matrix-product certificates, covers intermediate lengths by moment inequalities, and converts weight ratios to a gap."},"example":{"zh":"兩個 spin-1 的局部鍵 S₁·S₂=(J²−4)/2，總 spin j=0,1,2 對應能量 −2、−1、1。這個 9 維問題可直接對角化；但鏈中相鄰鍵不對易、不能都獨立取局部最低態，所以局部 gap=1 不證明整鏈 gap≥1。","en":"For two spin-one particles, S₁·S₂=(J²−4)/2 gives energies −2, −1 and 1 for total spin j=0,1,2. This nine-dimensional problem is directly diagonalizable. Neighboring bond terms in a chain do not commute and cannot minimize independently, so a local gap of one does not establish a chain gap of one."},"paths":{"zh":"入門：角動量耦合、有限鏈 exact diagonalization；進階：MPS、transfer operator、認證熱跡。可與自旋鏈低能模型及拓樸相連結；拓樸指標和開邊界端點態仍有獨立假設，不能由週期 gap 一句話全部推出。","en":"Learn angular-momentum coupling and exact diagonalization, then MPS, transfer operators and certified thermal traces. Connections include low-energy spin-chain models and topological phases; indices and open-boundary edge states require their own assumptions."},"assessment":{"zh":"需重跑整數／有理區間證書並查 bootstrap 同時控制所有長度；普通浮點 DMRG 曲線不是其證明前提。本導讀未重新執行全部 finite certificates。","en":"Audit the integer/rational interval certificates and a bootstrap covering all lengths. A floating-point DMRG curve is not the proof’s premise. The full finite certificates have not been re-executed here."},"sources":[{"label":"introduction.tex","path":"preprints/The-periodic-spin-one-Haldane-gap-September-24-2026/build/introduction.tex","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/The-periodic-spin-one-Haldane-gap-September-24-2026/build/introduction.tex","locator":"Equations eq:main-H, eq:main-gap; thm:main; How the proof works"}],"pdf":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/The-periodic-spin-one-Haldane-gap-September-24-2026/paper.pdf","status":"source-read-not-independently-verified"},{"familyId":"265","paperId":"265-01","title":{"zh":"二維糾纏面積律與 PEPS 的真實含義","en":"Two-dimensional entanglement area laws and what PEPS existence means"},"claim":{"zh":"主論文主張對有限誘導正方晶格上、有限局部維度、有限範圍有界交互作用且有唯一全域有能隙基態 Ω，任意區域 A 的 von Neumann 熵 SΩ(A)≤C|∂A|；C 只依局部維度、範圍、強度與 gap。","en":"The main paper claims SΩ(A)≤C|∂A| for every region A in a finite induced square-lattice domain with bounded finite-range interactions, finite local dimension and a unique globally gapped ground state. C depends only on local dimension, range, strength and gap."},"hypotheses":{"zh":"gap 是整個 Hamiltonian 的一致下界，不需每個子區域也有 gap。距離使用誘導圖內距離，含洞與不連通區域須照定義。唯一性、局域性與固定 gap 都不能刪除。","en":"The gap is a uniform bound for the full Hamiltonian, without assuming every restricted Hamiltonian is gapped. Range uses intrinsic induced-graph distance, including holes and disconnected domains. Uniqueness, locality and fixed gap are essential."},"why":{"zh":"一般 n 個 q-level 量子系統可有 O(n log q) 熵，面積律只隨邊界成長，表示局域有 gap 基態的資訊結構受限。這支持張量網路的表達能力，但不是高效找到張量或高效收縮的自動保證。","en":"General n-site q-level systems can have O(n log q) entropy. Boundary scaling constrains the information structure of local gapped ground states and motivates tensor-network representation, but does not automatically make finding or contracting the tensors efficient."},"roadmap":{"zh":"先以全域 gap 得到低於體積的初始熵指數，再建立湮滅基態的正準局域算子。於對稱多副本空間比較資訊增益與激發能量，掃描區域外的 collar，逐步放大遠端互資訊衰減。最後安排兩族幾何分離區域，利用熵鏈式法則消去區域本體項，只留下 O(|∂A|) 的邊界與可求和誤差。","en":"The global gap first gives a subvolume entropy exponent. Positive quasilocal operators annihilating the ground state are constructed. Symmetric-copy interpolations compare information gain with excitation cost while scanning collars and amplifying remote mutual-information decay. Two ordered families of separated regions then cancel interior entropy terms through chain rules, leaving boundary cost and summable errors."},"example":{"zh":"兩 qubit Bell 態 (|00⟩+|11⟩)/√2，單側約化態 I/2，S=ln2；乘積態 |00⟩ 的 S=0。若只有 b 對 Bell pair 跨過切割，總熵=b ln2，直觀顯示邊界鍵數控制糾纏；一般互動基態不能直接視為獨立 Bell pairs，需主定理論證。","en":"For a Bell pair (|00⟩+|11⟩)/√2, one side has reduced state I/2 and entropy ln2; |00⟩ has entropy zero. If b independent Bell pairs cross a cut, entropy is b ln2, illustrating boundary-controlled entanglement. General interacting ground states are not independent Bell pairs, so the theorem requires much more."},"paths":{"zh":"同家族 companion 對 open L×L 最近鄰模型主張存在 bond dimension≤CLᶜ、全域向量誤差≤L⁻¹ 的 PEPS；它還用額外壓縮和路由估計。可研究量子模擬表達能力，但沒有宣稱多項式時間構造、收縮或訓練。","en":"A companion claims PEPS existence on open L×L nearest-neighbor grids with bond dimension≤CLᶜ and global vector error≤L⁻¹, using additional compression and routing estimates. This concerns representational power, not polynomial-time construction, contraction or training."},"assessment":{"zh":"需核對熵放大與 collar 常數在任意區域一致、沒有暗中使用子區域 gap、以及典型子空間極限在幾何固定後進行。本頁未證實完整面積律。","en":"Audit uniform collar/entropy constants for arbitrary regions, absence of an implicit restricted-region gap and taking typical-subspace limits after fixing geometry. The full area law has not been independently verified here."},"sources":[{"label":"sections/00-introduction.tex","path":"preprints/A-two-dimensional-area-law-from-a-global-spectral-gap-September-24-2026/build/sections/00-introduction.tex","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/A-two-dimensional-area-law-from-a-global-spectral-gap-September-24-2026/build/sections/00-introduction.tex","locator":"Theorem thm:area; A tensor-network consequence; How the proof is organized"}],"pdf":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/preprints/A-two-dimensional-area-law-from-a-global-spectral-gap-September-24-2026/paper.pdf","status":"source-read-not-independently-verified"}]};
